{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/0333095c86e42846cebcf18a8187d720.avif?t=1763216621\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Department is a single-player narrative driven detective game. Investigate crime scenes, interrogate suspects and draw your own conclusion. Each case has multiple suspects, so you will always need to keep your wits about you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, because in The Department, how you solve a crime is often just as important as solving it. Mishandling evidence, and improper treatment of your suspects could lead to you failing to bring justice to the killer in question.\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/3b260ba8453754d6b69839a746156f21.poster.avif?t=1763216621\" width=660 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/3b260ba8453754d6b69839a746156f21.webm?t=1763216621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/3b260ba8453754d6b69839a746156f21.mp4?t=1763216621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mae Trosedd yn g\u00eam dditectif un-chwaraewr sy'n seiliedig ar stori. Ymchwiliwch wahanol olygfeydd, holi amheuon a dod i'ch casgliad eich hun. Mae gan bob achos ystod o amheuon, felly bydd angen i chi canolbwyntio ar y manylion pob tro. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Byddwch yn ofalus, oherwydd yn Drosedd, mae sut rydych chi'n datrys achos yn mor bwysig \u00e2 datrys yr achos ei hun. Os ydych chi\u2019n cam-drin tystiolaeth, a thrin eich amheuon yn anghywir, gallai arwain at fethiant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/7c4822c39d1b5f0d6f30d6c2fde9a423.poster.avif?t=1763216621\" width=660 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/7c4822c39d1b5f0d6f30d6c2fde9a423.webm?t=1763216621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/7c4822c39d1b5f0d6f30d6c2fde9a423.mp4?t=1763216621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1980540?t=1763216621","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/e90ea4186495dbdf6faf1bea600c02a94f2a8dd2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763216621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/32a9105c7e3b7dcc9342339efa5ca5d044a5eef0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763216621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/32a9105c7e3b7dcc9342339efa5ca5d044a5eef0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763216621","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Features crime scenes that some gamers may find distressing. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"ht